    {
      "id": "567a6d79-7adb-4671-b302-6dbd37a5bbe5",
      "name": "Overview and Setup",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        3296,
        1152
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 560,
        "height": 832,
        "content": "## Run bounded dunning for failed payments with Lago and email alerts\n\n### How it works\n\nThis workflow reacts to verified Lago payment events and routes failed payments, customer-action requests, recoveries, and unrelated events. It enriches failed invoices with customer data, retries payment only while a durable three-attempt limit permits, stores every outcome in an n8n Data Table, and sends a configurable billing alert for retries, manual review, customer action, or recovery.\n\n### Setup steps\n\n- Add a **Lago API** credential to the trigger and every Lago action node.\n- Add an **SMTP** credential to **Send Billing Alert**, then replace both example email addresses.\n- Select the **Lago Dunning State** table in every Data Table node. It needs the string fields `invoice_id`, `invoice_number`, `external_customer_id`, `customer_email`, `event_type`, `payment_status`, `state`, and `last_action`; number fields `retry_count` and `total_amount_cents`; and date field `last_event_at`.\n- Test the retry, manual-review, customer-action, recovery, and ignored-event paths before publishing.\n\n### Customization\n\nChange `maxRetries` in **Decide Whether To Retry**, replace email with Slack or PagerDuty, or add human approval for high-value invoices. If Lago Dunning Campaigns already retry these invoices, disable **Retry Failed Payment** and use this workflow only for state tracking and alerts."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "c1862bab-0300-4714-892f-ffd9b5212c64",
      "name": "Receive and Route Section",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        3920,
        1568
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 820,
        "height": 404,
        "content": "## Receive and route events\n\nVerifies and deduplicates incoming Lago payment events, normalizes their payloads, and routes each event to the appropriate dunning path."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "994122ba-00d5-41d1-90c4-93190b97bf71",
      "name": "Bounded Retry Section",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        4768,
        1280
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 1280,
        "height": 296,
        "content": "## Enrich and evaluate failure\n\nRetrieves the failed invoice and customer, loads durable retry state, and decides whether another payment attempt is allowed."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "42516e3c-1e29-43ae-b160-f9bd8b200f78",
      "name": "Customer Action Section",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        4768,
        1600
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 1080,
        "height": 268,
        "content": "## Request customer action\n\nPreserves the retry count and alerts billing with the authentication URL. This branch never retries payment automatically."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "7cc089be-c2bb-442d-9fb8-c0030528e397",
      "name": "Recovery Section",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        4768,
        1888
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 1080,
        "height": 268,
        "content": "## Record payment recovery\n\nResolves the durable dunning record while retaining the number of retries required to collect payment."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "1ddedcb7-14b0-41cf-ba62-037bc9343995",
      "name": "Ignored Event Section",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        4768,
        2192
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 420,
        "height": 296,
        "content": "## Explain ignored event\n\nRecords why an unexpected or incomplete Lago event did not trigger a billing action."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "304d1c4d-8869-4015-8787-4a851c253a27",
      "name": "Billing Alert Section",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        7264,
        1648
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 440,
        "height": 360,
        "content": "## Send billing alert\n\nConverges retry, manual-review, customer-action, and recovery notifications on one configurable email node."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "0b7f925c-4b6e-4e7f-9897-67a637dbb145",
      "name": "Retry Payment Section",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        6080,
        1104
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 1080,
        "height": 288,
        "content": "## Retry eligible payment\n\nRequests another collection attempt, records the updated retry state, and prepares the retry notification."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "6916673f-3622-4ec8-90d3-cc57756245ba",
      "name": "Manual Review Section",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        6080,
        1408
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 824,
        "height": 360,
        "content": "## Escalate to manual review\n\nRecords that the three-attempt limit or payment state prevents another retry, then prepares an actionable billing alert."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    }
  ],
